{#
  POST form of a non-GET View\Action (used by _action and _confirm; not meant as a public include).

  Required:
    - action: View\Action (method != GET)
    - action_href: resolved target URL
    - button_class, button_html (pre-rendered inner markup)

  Optional:
    - button_attrs: extra button attributes
    - form_id: id of the <form> (inputs outside it join through form="…", e.g. the type-to-confirm input)

  REQ-TWIG-005: the form always renders through form_start / form_end (_action_form_view). The FormView is
  action.form (CSRF-only FormView), else (2.18) a nameless CSRF-only form built from action.csrfToken in
  action.csrfField (nowo_ui_action_form(), Form\ActionCsrfType). PUT / PATCH / DELETE are spoofed with _method by
  form_start. Without symfony/form (or its Twig extension) the deprecated 2.17 raw form renders instead
  (_action_post_legacy, removed in 3.0).
#}
{% set button_attrs = button_attrs|default({}) %}
{% set action_form = nowo_ui_action_form(action) %}
{% if action_form is not null %}
    {{ include('@NowoUiKitBundle/partials/_action_form_view.html.twig', _context, false) }}
{% else %}
    {{ include('@NowoUiKitBundle/partials/_action_post_legacy.html.twig', _context, false) }}
{% endif %}
